OL,3,GNEWSAStudent paramedics use VR to train
OL,4,Afor emergencies
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudent paramedics at a university in
OL,7,FWest Yorkshire are believed to be the
OL,8,Ffirst in the UK to use virtual reality
OL,9,F(VR) technology as part of their
OL,10,Ftraining.
OL,12,FThe trainees at the University of
OL,13,FHuddersfield are using the technology
OL,14,Fto train for mass casualty incidents
OL,15,Fsuch as terrorist attacks and marauder
OL,16,Fattacks.
OL,18,FThe technology can be used by up to six
OL,19,Fstudents at a time in the immersive
OL,20,Fsuite in the Daphne Steele Building on
OL,21,Fthe university's National Health
OL,22,FInnovation Campus.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
