OL,3,GNEWSAStudent paramedics use VR to train
OL,4,Afor emergencies
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Holbrook, an A&E operations team
OL,7,Fleader for Yorkshire Ambulance Service,
OL,8,Fdescribed the experience as invaluable:
OL,9,F"They are getting to see as close to a
OL,10,Freal-life version as they can from in a
OL,11,Fclassroom."
